{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/909dd719e779b7038ea6b4467d16633d.avif?t=1763756241\" width=640 height=613 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A tale of Struggle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;..destiny won't stay idle as we fight it..&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/a0604bc40441f24930c871b23ce75bfd.poster.avif?t=1763756241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/a0604bc40441f24930c871b23ce75bfd.webm?t=1763756241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 </strong> <br><strong>Follow the story of the nine heroes in a cursed world with only seven days left. Witness the events from their point of view as the road to salvation is threatened by dark forces and each protagonist has a crucial role to play. With the chosen entering Guardiah, a knight seeking hope, a mage looking for answers and the monsters rebelling to humanity, the story will keep you engaged till the very end.    </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gameplay <br>\u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/444f9d3bc9e1ec2ab242c9568ad3392b.poster.avif?t=1763756241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/444f9d3bc9e1ec2ab242c9568ad3392b.webm?t=1763756241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Each protagonist has its own fighting style, from stealthy thieves to knights and mages, you will play as both humans and monsters. An ever changing gameplay that will keep your playthrough always fresh. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/04073e746da45eb29b30582abe5e2c97.avif?t=1763756241\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Among the heroes Roy and Eria are of a special kind. not only you can switch between them at will but they can also save each other if their beloved is in danger !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn Based !<br>\u00a0\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/8504c653ac292b8fea7cbe9aab8c4335.poster.avif?t=1763756241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/8504c653ac292b8fea7cbe9aab8c4335.webm?t=1763756241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast paced turn based combat deeply influenced by the field action so that an ambush or a critical moment can be overturn by winning a battle.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lore and fun <br>\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/a25a58ec02a56bed5c38b2b8c1afa280.poster.avif?t=1763756241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/a25a58ec02a56bed5c38b2b8c1afa280.webm?t=1763756241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the guilty pleasure of Skipping Cutscenes to see what happens..\u00a0 the game offers twice the story at the same price ! And while exploring you will find many books that will allow you to expand your knowledge, while not mandatory, there's plenty of Lore if you want to better understand the events of the world.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ten bad Fates<br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/0778e8d9c28c8dce6c1f6d83cad6d84b.poster.avif?t=1763756241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/0778e8d9c28c8dce6c1f6d83cad6d84b.webm?t=1763756241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten bad fates</strong> are there for you to discover while screwing up with many ways to die and unexpected ways to lose !<br>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>An Outstanding Soundtrack </strong><br><strong>\u00a0 </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/7e8c242ba0d7c98a85823c578db434c5.avif?t=1763756241\" width=1170 height=424 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0A fantastic soundtrack for an epic story, Fate of Fire boasts 42 tracks composed by the amazing <strong>Tim Beek</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Demo<br>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/0bccb23d70304b486ec2b5522481cfdc.avif?t=1763756241\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> \u00a0\u00a0 <br>A lengthy demo to introduce you to the story and let you taste the game playing with five of the main characters. The demo is always updated with the latest features and your progress will be loaded in the full version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have fun Saving Humanity !   </strong>     <br><strong>Denis ^^</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/46828791b955e88ee55d3b38463e7a46.avif?t=1763756241\" width=74 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Sight of Guardiah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/70ff21b18765d7e03800adfe136e592be24974f1.jpg"},{"name":"A shared burden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/d5d96dd7ac0fb488cb1a04417f68f698c62ac733.jpg"},{"name":"Feat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/b0c64994cf8df3ff80e90141be37bf2702c8f975.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/e62095132af19aa006186ca8df5cf7d21a49062b.jpg"},{"name":"Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/a97ed903719cf3b733fbec503a0bd611058894f4.jpg"},{"name":"Deaf Man Walking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/7acea9bc7da55af123726a54971e2b5733780320.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke",